    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109088" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποσᾰκίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>strain</i> or <i>filter away</i> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σακεύω</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>:—metaph. in 
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποσακίζεται τὰ χρήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
					645
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>trot,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. τῆς ὁδοῦ</span>”
				<i>go briskly forward,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.Dion.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					296
				</span></i>
			 (corrupted to <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποσκιάζειν</span>
			in <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				783.26
			</span></i>).</div>
